  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><p>Clobazam is a benzodiazepine used as an anticonvulsant to treat epilepsy, and also classed as an anxiolytic. It is an approved medicine, though as a benzodiazepine it carries a boxed warning and is a controlled substance.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q412164&quot;>Wikidata Q412164</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>clobazam</td></tr><tr><td>ATC codes:</td><td>N05BA09</td></tr><tr><td>DrugBank:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://go.drugbank.com/drugs/DB00349&quot;>DB00349</a></td></tr><tr><td>PubChem CID:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/2789&quot;>2789</a></td></tr><tr><td>ChEBI:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/searchId.do?chebiId=CHEBI:31413&quot;>31413</a></td></tr><tr><td>Wikidata:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q412164&quot;>Q412164</a></td></tr><tr><td>formula:</td><td>C16H13ClN2O2</td></tr><tr><td>molar mass:</td><td>300.742 g/mol (PubChem)</td></tr></table></body></html>"));
